        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 943, Jacksonville Solid Brass Lever with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a sleek, modern appearance Omnia's 943/00 Jacksonville Leverset is the perfect finishing touch for anyone looking to update their space. The Jacksonville Lever with Round Rose is made out of solid brass built to last. It is available in privacy, passage, and dummy functions. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the will fit doors 1-3/8 inches, 1-3/4 inches, or 2 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-75028-SM.jpg?v=1704354609\" width=\"377\" height=\"198\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia #943S specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/jacksonville-lever-with-square-rose-omnia-943s-00\"><b>Jacksonville Lever with Square Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Jacksonville Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 943 Contemporary Jacksonville Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Jacksonville Lever with Round Rose",
                "description": "With a sleek, modern appearance Omnia's 943/00 Jacksonville Leverset is the perfect finishing touch for anyone looking to update their space. The Jacksonville Lever with Round Rose is made out of solid brass built to last. It is available in privacy, passage, and dummy functions. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the will fit doors 1-3/8 inches, 1-3/4 inches, or 2 inches thick.\r\n",
